{"target": {"id": "SurgeToken.sol:function:20161:1222", "kind": "function", "contract": "SurgeToken", "signature": "purchase(address,uint256)", "visibility": "internal", "source": "function purchase(address buyer, uint256 bnbAmount) internal returns (bool) {
        // make sure we don't buy more than the bnb in this contract
        require(bnbAmount <= address(this).balance, 'purchase not included in balance');
        // previous amount of BNB before we received any        
        uint256 prevBNBAmount = (address(this).balance).sub(bnbAmount);
        // if this is the first purchase, use current balance
        prevBNBAmount = prevBNBAmount == 0 ? address(this).balance : prevBNBAmount;
        // find the number of tokens we should mint to keep up with the current price
        uint256 nShouldPurchase = hyperInflatePrice ? _totalSupply.mul(bnbAmount).div(address(this).balance) : _totalSupply.mul(bnbAmount).div(prevBNBAmount);
        // apply our spread to tokens to inflate price relative to total supply
        uint256 tokensToSend = nShouldPurchase.mul(spreadDivisor).div(10**2);
        // revert if under 1
        if (tokensToSend < 1) {
            revert('Must Buy More Than One Surge');
        }

        // mint the tokens we need to the buyer
        mint(buyer, tokensToSend);
        emit Transfer(address(this), buyer, tokensToSend);
        return true;
    }"}, "available_context": [{"id": "SurgeToken.sol:state_variable:17267:32", "kind": "state_variable", "name": "SurgeToken._totalSupply", "reasons": ["state variable declaration: _totalSupply"]}, {"id": "SurgeToken.sol:function:19227:853", "kind": "function", "name": "_transferFrom(address,address,uint256)", "reasons": ["direct writer of state variable: _totalSupply"]}, {"id": "SurgeToken.sol:function:21466:1070", "kind": "function", "name": "sell(uint256)", "reasons": ["direct writer of state variable: _totalSupply"]}, {"id": "SurgeToken.sol:function:22778:173", "kind": "function", "name": "mint(address,uint256)", "reasons": ["direct writer of state variable: _totalSupply"]}, {"id": "SurgeToken.sol:function:16939:6529", "kind": "function", "name": "slitherConstructorVariables()", "reasons": ["direct writer of state variable: _totalSupply", "direct writer of state variable: hyperInflatePrice", "direct writer of state variable: spreadDivisor"]}, {"id": "SurgeToken.sol:state_variable:17542:37", "kind": "state_variable", "name": "SurgeToken.hyperInflatePrice", "reasons": ["state variable declaration: hyperInflatePrice"]}, {"id": "SurgeToken.sol:state_variable:17466:33", "kind": "state_variable", "name": "SurgeToken.spreadDivisor", "reasons": ["state variable declaration: spreadDivisor"]}], "context_complete": false, "task": "verify_static_analysis_finding", "finding": {"id": "0d1056a6b05f35c0661820fd228845121f557c692860dd5fbbf953fb28675bea", "tool": "slither", "detector": "incorrect-equality", "impact": "Medium", "confidence": "High", "description": "SurgeToken.purchase(address,uint256) (examples/defihacklabs/evaluation/final20/contracts/xsurge/raw/SurgeToken.sol#554-574) uses a dangerous strict equality:
